"Timer 在 OC / Swift 侧只是语言不同：OC 侧 JobsOCTimer、Swift 侧 JobsSwiftTimer，都是把系统 Timer / GCD / DisplayLink / RunLoop 的杂乱细节收口成少量参数。\\n\\n应用层副产物应该归到 Timer 体系下，例如倒计时按钮、时钟、红包雨、抽奖轮盘、跑马灯和轮播图。\\n\\nTimerMgr 是多个 Timer 的统一注册表：OC 侧 JobsOCTimerMgr、Swift 侧 JobsSwiftTimerMgr，都按 identifier 管理 start / pause / resume / stop。\\n\\nJobsMarqueeView 用 JobsOCTimerMgr 做统一内核，把跑马灯和轮播图收口成同一个 UIScrollView + UIButton 数据源组件。" = "Timer differs between OC and Swift only by language: JobsOCTimer on the OC side and JobsSwiftTimer on the Swift side both wrap the messy details of system Timer / GCD / DisplayLink / RunLoop into a small set of parameters.\\n\\nApplication-layer derivatives should belong to the Timer system, such as countdown buttons, clocks, red packet rain, lucky wheels, marquees, and carousels.\\n\\nTimerMgr is the registry for multiple timers: JobsOCTimerMgr on OC and JobsSwiftTimerMgr on Swift both manage start / pause / resume / stop by identifier.\\n\\nJobsMarqueeView uses JobsOCTimerMgr as the unified core, turning marquee and carousel into one UIScrollView + UIButton data-source component.";
